WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:07.220
In 1961, the SCP Foundation discovered a town
that was completely devoid of all life.

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:11.460
Not long before their arrival, Darrington,
North Carolina, had been a community with

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.280
high aspirations.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:18.760
A deeply religious township of devout Christians,
many of whom were seeking greater prosperity

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:19.760
from their lives.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:25.349
But now, their home was a ghost town, with
no sign of any prior Darrington resident to

00:00:25.349 --> 00:00:26.440
be found.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:28.660
Where the hell had they all gone?

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:32.579
It hardly seemed likely that the population
of an entire town would all simultaneously

00:00:32.579 --> 00:00:35.680
decide to up sticks and leave to pastures
new.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:40.110
But then again, maybe the citizens of Darrington
hadn’t left at all.

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:45.540
Perhaps they weren’t even really still human,
and had taken up residence somewhere much

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:46.540
darker…

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.660
like underground?

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:53.430
This is the story of one of the earliest known
instances of a phenomena now known under the

00:00:53.430 --> 00:01:01.329
designation of SCP-3089, or to use its alternative
name: That Old Time Religion.

00:01:01.329 --> 00:01:07.240
When the SCP Foundation arrived in a desolate
Darrington to find the townsfolk had all vanished,

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:12.530
they immediately began an investigation into
the exact ‘how’s and ‘why’s, the answers

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:14.830
to what exactly had happened here.

00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:20.170
After all, while not a huge place, Darrington
was home to nearly a thousand residents, and

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:22.780
that many people don’t just disappear.

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:25.840
If they even had disappeared and weren’t
just… dormant.

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:31.290
But what the Foundation uncovered was a gruesome
discovery, that led to them not only demolishing

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:36.790
the entire North Carolinian town, but purchasing
all the land around it to keep the area under

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:38.960
permanent observation.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:43.579
Prior to demolition, however, the Ministry
of Sevenfold Blessing had been one of the

00:01:43.579 --> 00:01:47.200
oldest buildings in Darrington, much like
most town churches.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:52.210
And it was while searching the offices of
this church that Foundation clean-up crews

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:57.200
discovered their first piece of evidence,
the initial clue about what had happened to

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.990
this deserted town.

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:03.219
They recovered a series of cassette tapes,
each with a recording of sermons that had

00:02:03.219 --> 00:02:06.490
been given within the Ministry of Sevenfold
Blessing.

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:11.500
These were all delivered by one Pastor Bartholomew
Jenner, the first having been recorded on

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:15.519
August 17th of 1959, two years earlier.

00:02:15.519 --> 00:02:20.780
“My friends, I want to talk to you about
the Bible offers, tonight,” Pastor Jenner

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:22.819
began in the first of these recordings.

00:02:22.819 --> 00:02:25.709
“I want to talk to you about what you are
owed.

00:02:25.709 --> 00:02:27.210
I want to talk to you about…

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:31.170
I want to talk to those of you who are struggling,
right now.

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:34.350
To those of you who have hardship and pain.

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:38.610
Maybe you’ve heard that the Bible only nourishes
the spirit; that God provides only for our

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:39.650
immortal souls.

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:44.840
Well, my friends, I am here to tell you that
this is simply not true.”

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:49.790
Pastor Bartholomew Jenner seemed to be focused
on the discussion of very real, relatable

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:50.930
problems.

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:55.390
After all, what person hasn’t felt unsatisfied
with their life at one point or another?

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:58.879
And this was apparently no different for the
people of Darrington.

00:02:58.879 --> 00:03:03.490
“Many of you can think of places in your
lives where you have not yet risen.

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.320
Where you are not yet victorious.

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:06.320
Marriage.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:07.320
Finances.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.320
Health.

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:09.930
But do not fret, my friends.

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:11.590
God wants you to rise.

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:13.780
He has cleared the path for you.

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:18.130
It is one littered with His earthly treasures;
to claim them, you need only to shed your

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.410
old selves and be reborn.”

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:24.850
The pastor was merely using the shared faith
of the township to help reaffirm that their

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.970
struggles were not the be all and end all
of their lives.

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:31.069
Or at least, that’s how it first appeared.

00:03:31.069 --> 00:03:35.580
But the religious practices taking place in
this first recording would soon take a bizarre

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:41.290
turn, making it clear there was something
far more sinister, even cult-like, going on

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:43.680
in the Ministry of Sevenfold Blessing.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:45.470
“Now, if you would…

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:49.220
some of the ladies from the mayor's office
were kind enough to collect these cicada shells.

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:50.220
Pass them along.

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:53.079
Each of you take one – yes, the children
too.

00:03:53.079 --> 00:03:54.200
Be careful.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.319
Very careful.

00:03:55.319 --> 00:03:56.680
They are fragile.

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:59.230
Each of you, take one, and hold it in your
left hand.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:00.230
Yes.

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:01.930
The left hand, not the right.

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:02.930
Your left.”

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:07.040
The shells of dead cicadas hardly seemed like
common fare for a sermon like this.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:11.650
Although, as the recording continued, it was
easy to understand that Pastor Jenner intended

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:17.250
these discarded insect carapaces to be something
of a metaphor, even if they were pretty gross

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:21.190
– especially to some of the younger members
of his congregation.

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:25.600
He explained to the Darrington residents that
these cicada shells were meant to be symbolic

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:30.210
of whatever hardship the citizens were currently
struggling with in their lives; whether it

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:33.880
was work, a marriage, or an ill family member.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:38.460
Then came the next part of this unorthodox
practice; the pastor instructed everyone in

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:43.130
the congregation to picture themselves holding
their biggest problem in their left hand…

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:46.910
“Now, I want you to squeeze your left hand.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:48.350
Squeeze it into a fist.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:52.020
Feel that problem cracking; like old, dried
out paper.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:56.789
Feel it crumble to dust,” Jenner told them,
and the residents of Darrington did so, crushing

00:04:56.789 --> 00:04:59.300
their cicada shells until there was nothing
left.

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:00.760
“Everyone, open your eyes.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:02.650
Don't you feel better?

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:03.650
Stronger?

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.490
This is what is offered.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:10.810
Our hardships are like the shell; we shall
cast them aside even as they crumble.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.850
God has cleared a path.”

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:17.030
Needless to say, the Foundation agents that
recovered the tapes of Pastor Jenner’s odd

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:19.750
sermons weren’t entirely sure what to make
of them.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:24.050
And as unusual as they were, the recordings
did little to indicate where the townspeople

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:27.190
of Darrington, North Carolina, had disappeared
to.

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:32.320
But as they listened further, what they found
was even more unsettling than an entire congregation

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:34.840
of people crushing cicada shells.

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:40.930
In the second recording, dated December 19th
of 1959, Pastor Jenner was once again presiding

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:41.930
over his congregation.

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:47.289
He had just finished quoting a passage from
Matthew, chapter twenty-five, verse thirty,

00:05:47.289 --> 00:05:51.440
which related to a Biblical tale known as
the Parable of the Talents.

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:55.470
In this story, a master puts his servants
in charge of a differently sized portion of

00:05:55.470 --> 00:06:00.400
his wealth while he is away, then judges them
based on whether or not his servants make

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:02.100
a profit using his money.

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:06.590
The third servant, who had received the least
talents – meaning an amount of money – was

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:11.970
punished for burying his share in the ground;
“cast into the outer darkness” to face

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:14.210
“weeping and gnashing of teeth.”

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:19.490
It was after making mention of this unprofitable
servant that Pastor Jenner went on to address

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:25.430
even more of the bizarre, almost ritualistic,
practices he had been introducing to his sermons.

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:29.750
“Now, some of you have expressed concerns
over the new sacraments.

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:31.870
A few have even called them sacrilege.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:34.990
And yet, have we not prospered?

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:40.789
Have these same nay-sayers, these same ‘Doubting
Thomases’ not profited from our good works?”

00:06:40.789 --> 00:06:41.789
the pastor declared.

00:06:41.789 --> 00:06:46.910
“I have shown you how to heal the sick with
the Lord’s Prayer and the blood of an unbaptized

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:47.910
child.

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:52.389
I have shown you how to see your future in
the steaming entrails of a quivering crow.

00:06:52.389 --> 00:06:55.249
I have shown you the path to glory.

00:06:55.249 --> 00:06:57.410
But I cannot make you follow this path.

00:06:57.410 --> 00:07:02.710
I can only show it to you; it is you and you
alone who must follow it – who must rise

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:05.240
and shed your old self.”

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.530
Shed your old self.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:12.020
The words immediately called to mind the image
of the cicadas, insects that discard their

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:15.030
outer carapaces and emerge anew.

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:19.789
Bugs that also burrow into the ground and
wait, lying dormant under the earth for years

00:07:19.789 --> 00:07:20.910
at a time.

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:25.620
All before they emerge, rising up again…
so they can spread.

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:29.790
It was becoming clear that Pastor Jenner was
certainly deviating further and further from

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:32.380
the church’s normal religious practices.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:37.130
His bold and blatant descriptions of what
sounded like ritualistic sacrifices were shocking

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:42.150
enough to hear; speaking of using blood and
entrails to bring the town the prosperity

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:43.150
it sought.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:47.629
But if that wasn’t bad enough, the worst
was still yet to come… contained within

00:07:47.629 --> 00:07:49.669
the third and final recording.

00:07:49.669 --> 00:07:55.240
Unlike the previous cassettes, most of the
sermon from June 7th 1960 was almost completely

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.720
unintelligible.

00:07:56.720 --> 00:08:00.960
And without any visual evidence to go with
it, it was hard for the Foundation to make

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:03.310
out exactly what was going on.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:08.190
It began with another quote from Matthew,
this time chapter twenty-eight, verse six;

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:12.470
which made mention of the resurrection of
Jesus, that he had risen, and that people

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:14.560
should come and see where the Lord lay.

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:19.660
“Not a metaphor, my friends,” Pastor Jenner
explained, before urging his congregation

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:21.650
to join in some kind of formation.

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:22.870
“Step forward.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:25.750
Mothers behind their daughters, fathers behind
their sons.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:27.169
Turn to face the…”

00:08:27.169 --> 00:08:31.870
The recording became unintelligible again
after that point, with only a few more words

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:32.870
being audible.

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:37.529
The pastor seemed to have gathered the townsfolk
of Darrington, presumably for some new form

00:08:37.529 --> 00:08:38.529
of ritual.

00:08:38.529 --> 00:08:42.690
He encouraged the town’s children to close
their eyes and pray, before reminding the

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:47.670
congregation that God sacrificed the life
of his only son, Jesus.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:51.780
Frighteningly, it appeared that Pastor Jenner
was implying the adults of Darrington should

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.170
do the same.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:56.080
One of the next fragments of his sermon that
could be deciphered declared:

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:58.550
“…lamb is slaughtered to feed the lion.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.890
The Son is slaughtered to feed…”

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:04.550
Between more and more noise interfering with
the recording, Pastor Jenner could be heard

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:07.740
saying:
“The pact is complete.

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:10.920
This world shall be our paradise.”

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:17.110
Before encouraging his congregation – or
those who were left – to dig deep and wait.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:19.970
Then came perhaps the most horrific part of
the tape.

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:24.270
The remainder of the recording lasted thirty
minutes, comprised of pure static.

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:29.019
Or, the Foundation agents listening to it
assumed, at first, that it was just interference.

00:09:29.019 --> 00:09:33.040
But further audio analysis seemed to suggest
that the long, continuous mass of hissing

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:37.590
wasn’t static at all; it was the chittering
sound of insects…

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.480
like the noise made by cicadas.

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:43.460
For a time, the incident at Darrington left
the Foundation baffled.

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:46.990
There seemed to be no clear answer as to what
had happened.

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:51.690
Not one of the town’s residents was anywhere
to be found, and on top of that, there were

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:52.970
no bodies.

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:57.880
No remains of any kind to speak of; if they
were dead, there would at least be some kind

00:09:57.880 --> 00:09:59.070
of trace.

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:03.730
And then there were all the questions raised
by Pastor Bartholomew Jenner’s strange sermons;

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:06.940
why did he seem so focused on enacting rituals?

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:09.740
Did any of his methods really benefit the
town?

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:15.160
And why did he place so much emphasis on…
cicadas, of all things?

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:19.920
Answers were few and far between, although
almost six decades after the Foundation discovered

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:24.620
the desolate town of Darrington, a new development
would come to light…

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:27.720
To be more accurate, it was fifty-six years
later.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:33.870
On the 11th January 2017, a Foundation agent
named Daniel Mitchell was patrolling the area

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:38.550
that had formerly been Darrington, North Carolina
– before the Foundation had demolished all

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:40.029
traces of the town.

00:10:40.029 --> 00:10:44.500
By this point, the SCP Foundation had long
thought that they had figured out exactly

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:49.990
what SCP-3089 was; they had even encountered
it emerging in a number of different forms

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:52.620
in both 2007 and 2015.

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:57.959
However, it was what Daniel Mitchell happened
across during the routine monthly patrol that

00:10:57.959 --> 00:11:00.529
revealed the horrifying truth.

00:11:00.529 --> 00:11:05.339
At the outskirts of the area where the town
had once been, a series of sinkholes had opened

00:11:05.339 --> 00:11:10.100
up, at some point between the previous monthly
check and this one in early 2017.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:14.420
And if you think that these sinkholes caused
a disturbance in the earth and uncovered all

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:18.240
the bodies of the former residents or Darrington,
you’d be wrong.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:21.220
It was far, far stranger…

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:25.899
The Foundation conducted a full-scale examination
of the sinkholes around the demolished North

00:11:25.899 --> 00:11:26.899
Carolinian town.

00:11:26.899 --> 00:11:31.060
And these weren’t just a few patches of
loose ground that had sunk through.

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:35.360
The geological survey the Foundation carried
out quickly revealed that these sinkholes

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:38.610
led to an extensive network of tunnels deep
underground.

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:43.270
They extended several hundred kilometers outwards,
practically covering the entire underside

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:45.190
of where Darrington had been.

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:50.510
The tunnels seemed far too big than any other
created by any natural means, but the entire

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:56.200
network also appeared too rudimentary, too
imperfect to have been carved using any modern

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:58.860
excavation technology like a large drill.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:03.709
Plus, if equipment like that had been on site,
the Foundation would have noticed, as they

00:12:03.709 --> 00:12:05.279
kept the area monitored.

00:12:05.279 --> 00:12:09.750
It was almost like something had been burrowing
through the ground, only to eventually crawl

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:13.070
back up to the surface, resulting in the sinkholes.

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:17.410
What’s more, the Foundation’s geological
tests suggested that the network of tunnels

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:19.840
was almost four whole decades old.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:24.510
That would have placed the date of their creation
about ten years after the disappearances of

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:26.230
everyone in Darrington.

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:31.329
Naturally, the Foundation immediately launched
a mission to explore more of the tunnels.

00:12:31.329 --> 00:12:35.579
Before even completing a full sweep of the
underground space in its entirety, they had

00:12:35.579 --> 00:12:38.089
made another discovery.

00:12:38.089 --> 00:12:43.030
Contained within the tunnels was over a whole
ton of organic material that had been mostly

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.720
preserved without decomposing too much.

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:50.440
The SCP Foundation began gathering samples
for testing, finding most of this material

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.980
to be severely desiccated dermis tissue.

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:58.860
That’s the dense layer of skin beneath the
epidermis, and it had all been entirely dried

00:12:58.860 --> 00:12:59.860
out.

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:02.339
But that wasn’t all the testing uncovered.

00:13:02.339 --> 00:13:07.040
According to genetic analysis, the tissue
had two distinct types of DNA present.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:11.959
The first being easily identified as human
genetic material, which made sense.

00:13:11.959 --> 00:13:15.839
Despite the material lacking in moisture,
the dermis tissue didn’t match the skin

00:13:15.839 --> 00:13:17.380
of any other mammal.

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:20.040
But then there was the other DNA present.

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:24.720
Combined with the expected human DNA was the
presence of something else that the Foundation

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:28.390
researchers had quite some difficulty finding
a match for.

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:33.630
Eventually, they determined that this genetic
material entangled with human DNA belonged

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:39.480
to the Cicadtta montana… better known as
the New Forest cicada.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.260
Cicadas again.

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:46.959
Cicada DNA mixed with human DNA, discovered
in a large network of underground tunnels.

00:13:46.959 --> 00:13:51.579
All beneath the same town where a pastor had
his congregation crush cicada shells in their

00:13:51.579 --> 00:13:54.600
left hands during one of his sermons.

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:59.140
Ten years before the sinkhole incident, the
Foundation was alerted to a particular YouTube

00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:03.140
channel by the name of ‘Kai Sanchez: Positively
Rich’.

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:07.320
On the surface, Kai was one of many online
grifters, preaching about how easy it was

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:12.240
to quickly achieve an obscene amount of wealth
by simply believing in yourself.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:17.279
Usually, if not always, these types of people
were trying to scam their audience of loyal

00:14:17.279 --> 00:14:22.540
subscribers into investing in some kind of
illicit moneymaking scheme or any number of

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:27.070
other cons; promising their followers easy
money that never came.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:29.720
But Kai Sanchez’s channel was slightly different.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:34.180
So much so that the Foundation had to contain
his entire audience, deeming them to have

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:37.420
been affected by SCP-3089.

00:14:37.420 --> 00:14:43.120
The video that caught the Foundation’s attention
was an hour-long upload from Kai titled ‘Seven

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:45.380
Secrets to Ascend the Ladder of Prosperity’.

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:51.279
There was that word again – prosperity – the
same thing Pastor Jenner had promised his

00:14:51.279 --> 00:14:53.601
congregation in Darrington.

00:14:53.601 --> 00:14:55.570
And the similarities didn’t end there.

00:14:55.570 --> 00:15:01.180
In his video, much like the pastor during
his sermons, Kai Sanchez encouraged his audience

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:04.320
to visualize their success in order to achieve
it.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:08.620
He implied that the human consciousness could
impact reality; for example, if his viewers

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:13.461
just imagined themselves having a bigger bank
account or looking more attractive, then these

00:15:13.461 --> 00:15:16.790
things would manifest themselves in the real
world.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:21.950
One of Kai’s ‘Secrets to Ascend the Ladder
of Prosperity’ was as follows: “Visualize

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:23.000
your ascendance.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:27.110
Re-imagine yourself as someone who can reach
the top of that ladder.

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:28.160
Shed your old identity.

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.279
Tear it off and throw it aside – like dead
skin.

00:15:30.279 --> 00:15:31.589
You won't need it.

00:15:31.589 --> 00:15:32.790
Not where you're going.”

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:35.899
The resemblance to Pastor Jenner’s sermons
was uncanny.

00:15:35.899 --> 00:15:40.810
Kai’s video even encouraged that his audience
leave scraps out to lure stray cats into their

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:46.120
homes, and then, once they had one, to take
a knife and… well, you remember what happened

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.460
in Darrington.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:53.220
But Kai Sanchez made sure to specify: “Remember
to hold the knife with your left hand…”

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:57.040
Another online community was tagged by the
Foundation for similar teachings.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:01.480
This group of insular men were trying to apply
the same methodology primarily to attract

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:02.480
women.

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:06.150
However, they also reasoned it could be used
to improve their own financial status and

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:11.320
physical stature; all done through visualizing
and believing that doing so would make these

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:12.970
things improve.

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:15.900
That having faith would grant them prosperity.

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:20.750
This disturbed community even tried to use
bug-rattlers to emit frequencies to aid in

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.399
attracting women.

00:16:22.399 --> 00:16:26.639
Contained within these rattlers were the preserved
remains of… cicadas.

00:16:26.639 --> 00:16:31.750
Male cicadas have tymbals, structures on their
outer shell that emit a loud hissing, chittering

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:37.910
noise that they often use to find a mate,
after spending so much time dormant underground…

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:39.990
before burrowing up to the surface.

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:44.649
And if you’ve been paying attention, you
might be able to guess exactly where this

00:16:44.649 --> 00:16:45.779
is going…

00:16:45.779 --> 00:16:51.370
SCP-3089 is a phenomenon that occurs within
communities of people who are seeking some

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:53.199
form of prosperity.

00:16:53.199 --> 00:16:57.750
Whether that community be a town, a group
of like-minded people online, or any other

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:58.900
group of collected individuals.

00:16:58.900 --> 00:17:04.740
The particular type of prosperity these people
are all seeking can be anything; from spiritual

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:07.490
enlightenment, to financial success.

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:14.150
The SCP Foundation doesn’t yet quite understand
exactly how SCP-3089 starts, only that communities

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:18.970
affected by it will attempt to achieve their
chosen material success through the application

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:25.460
of rituals, like visualizing what they hope
to overcome and achieve, and practicing sacrifices.

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:30.490
In short, these people have to believe these
acts will grant them what they want.

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:34.840
They need to be willing to go far enough to
do unspeakable things.

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:37.470
They need to have faith.

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:42.810
Although what they don’t realize is, some
things can feed on that faith, they can harvest

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:43.810
it…

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:47.780
Before these communities realize the terrible
things that they have done – or who exactly

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:52.100
has tricked them into performing these rituals
– they’ll begin to undergo a horrific

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:59.850
transformation process; known as SCP-3089-B.
It begins in the chrysalis stage.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:04.530
Members of a community that has been affected
by SCP-3089 will experience a declined state

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:05.929
of metabolism.

00:18:05.929 --> 00:18:11.890
Now classified as instances of SCP-3089-A,
their brain activity, heart rate, and body

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:14.370
temperature will all begin to lower.

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:18.800
Over a period of between three and six hours,
these people will then suffer a change to

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:21.850
their epidermis – the outer layer of skin.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:26.080
It starts to harden, until it has formed a
dense, brittle substance…

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.419
like a shell.

00:18:27.419 --> 00:18:31.900
Next comes the second stage of SCP-3089-B:
metamorphosis.

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:38.990
Internally, SCP-3089-A individuals will develop
a number of teratomas – a type of germ cell

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:44.600
tumor that can contain several different types
of tissue, such as hair, muscle, and bone.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:48.880
During the next two or three weeks, these
tumors will expand and dissolve the person’s

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:50.480
soft tissue.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:53.480
Then there’s the final stage: emergence.

00:18:53.480 --> 00:19:00.060
An instance of SCP-3089-A will exit its dormant
state that began in the initial stage.

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:05.570
Once they have awoken, then… something exits
the outer epidermal shell.

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:07.530
It will not communicate.

00:19:07.530 --> 00:19:12.101
Some will retain remnants of internal organs
– such as eyes or lungs – however, these

00:19:12.101 --> 00:19:15.350
are vestigial, no longer serving any purpose.

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:19.020
The brain functions deviate from any normal
human patterns.

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:24.280
Having completed the process, this… thing
will attempt to burrow down into the soil

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:26.490
via any means at its disposal.

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:28.299
An outer shell.

00:19:28.299 --> 00:19:30.160
Digging into the soil.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:32.080
The tunnels underneath Darrington.

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:34.940
The genetic material uncovered below.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.240
Dermis tissue with two types of DNA.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:40.070
A mix of human … and cicada.

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:41.720
There is something out there.

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:45.960
It is preying on people’s faith, their longing
for prosperity.

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:50.679
Then, when these communities are presented
with someone who can take advantage of that

00:19:50.679 --> 00:19:56.720
faith – like Pastor Jenner or Kai Sanchez
– they find themselves encouraged to push

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:58.980
their faith to its furthest limit.

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:03.320
And then, they’re rewarded by becoming something
else…

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:05.240
something nightmarish.

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:09.950
The question is: when they wake up, and crawl
back out from their tunnels, leaving a sinkhole

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:13.650
in their wake… where do these cicada creatures
go?

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:16.230
Want to own an SCP of your own?

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:20.250
Go to scpswag.com for premium anomalous merchandise!

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:27.179
Now go and check out “SCP-3004 INSECT GOD
IMAGO” and “SCP-2852 SADISTIC MADMAN PARTY

00:20:27.179 --> 00:20:32.170
CRASHER COUSIN JOHNNY” to uncover more information
